Interval [text box] - Generator
Type in the Interval, i.e., the time between two activations of the Interval Control.
Remarks
Type in 0 to not trigger any controls and stop the Generator.
You can also select any of the probability distributions. Then, you have to type in the parameters, which
the selected distribution requires.
You can set the type of the distribution and a complete set of parameters with the method
setTypeAndAttr.
Generator.Interval.setTypeAndAttr("dEmp", Table)
